Alembic canonical migration system for api-gateway.

Use only:
- alembic.ini
- alembic/env.py
- alembic/versions/*

Legacy migrations directory has been retired.

Validation commands:
- alembic -c apps/api-gateway/alembic.ini heads
- alembic -c apps/api-gateway/alembic.ini branches
- alembic -c apps/api-gateway/alembic.ini history --verbose
- alembic -c apps/api-gateway/alembic.ini upgrade head
